translate schinese intro_bcea5bbc:

    # pr "Oh! Hi! Welcome to Eden!"
    pr "哦！你好！欢迎来到 Eden！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:10
translate schinese intro_a8fd0cb5:

    # pr "We are so excited to have you here!"
    pr "你能来这里我们太兴奋了！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:11
translate schinese intro_cb90e6a7:

    # pr "This project was created by a pair of degenerates to learn how to properly make AVNs, so keep that in mind in the early parts of this game."
    pr "这个项目是两个混蛋为了学习怎么正确制作 AVN 而做的，所以前期部分请多多包涵。"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:14
translate schinese intro_f9828276:

    # pr "The only thing that’s consistently good, is the programming and UI."
    pr "唯一始终做得不错的就是编程和 UI。"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:15
translate schinese intro_13daa1f5:

    # pr "Our writer/artist is kinda shit, but don’t tell him that!"
    pr "我们的编剧/画师有点烂，但别告诉他！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:17
translate schinese intro_589a9588:

    # F "I swear I didn't tell him to say that."
    F "我发誓我没让他那么说。"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:20
translate schinese intro_84a0020b:

    # pr "Alright so let’s see…"
    pr "好了，那么……"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:21
translate schinese intro_f0f6f39f:

    # pr "What… is your name?"
    pr "你……叫什么名字？"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:32
translate schinese intro_f07aed8d:

    # pr "What… is your age?"
    pr "你……多大了？"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:39
translate schinese intro_84087376:

    # pr "Splendid!"
    pr "太好了！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:43
translate schinese intro_bf09f283:

    # pr "Aww… come back when you’re legal!"
    pr "唉……等你成年了再来吧！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:49
translate schinese intro_5c8c2ba2:

    # pr "What… is your quest?"
    pr "你……的目标是什么？"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:58
translate schinese intro_dd052ee6:

    # pr "Oh no you don’t!"
    pr "你休想！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:59
translate schinese intro_e21c9756:

    # pr "You are not getting me to show them my boobs!"
    pr "你们休想让我给你们看胸！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:60
translate schinese intro_47ca2d3c:

    # pr "Jerks!"
    pr "混蛋们！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:64
translate schinese intro_e091de07:

    # pr "*Giggles* Good, you might make it far."
    pr "*咯咯笑* 不错嘛，你可能还能撑挺久。"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:68
translate schinese intro_6000001d:

    # pr "Anyway…"
    pr "总之……"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:71
translate schinese intro_7482f287:

    # pr "You’ll be able to see clear progression in terms of writing and rendering as the game develops."
    pr "随着游戏推进，你会明显看出写作和渲染上的进步。"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:72
translate schinese intro_d55bb1bf:

    # pr "Our busy bees have committed to not reworking the game until the game is finished."
    pr "我们勤恳的小蜜蜂们已经立志：在游戏完结之前绝不返工。"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:76
translate schinese intro_7ce73d0e:

    # pr "That said, the early game is quite… rough…"
    pr "话虽如此，前期内容确实相当……粗糙……"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:80
translate schinese intro_604c5996:

    # pr "But it gets so much better later on!"
    pr "但后面会好很多！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:83
translate schinese intro_4497e07c:

    # pr "Sooooo yeah… bear with us, this is a once in a lifet-"
    pr "所、所以说……多多包涵，这是一生只有一——"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:86
translate schinese intro_81f7d035:

    # pr "Wait no… wrong world."
    pr "等等不对……说错世界了。"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:87
translate schinese intro_51aa9bd4:

    # pr "Ummm…"
    pr "呃……"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:90
translate schinese intro_2abd7f7b:

    # pr "A-anyway!"
    pr "总、总之！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:93
translate schinese intro_18c0787f:

    # pr "The writer of this game decided on making this game purely kinetic, so keep that in mind as well!"
    pr "这游戏的作者决定把游戏做成纯动态文字的，所以这点也请一并考虑！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:94
translate schinese intro_5d28a2b3:

    # pr "You can disable puzzles, QTEs, and change the animations of the textbox in preferences."
    pr "你可以在偏好设置里关闭解谜和 QTE，也可以更改文本框动画。"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:97
translate schinese intro_c62d6b4f:

    # pr "Aaaaand that’s about all there is to it!"
    pr "啊啊大致就是这些！"

# game/chapters/intro/intro.rpy:98
translate schinese intro_d0398d9b:

    # pr "Good luck, have fun, get some snacks, some lube, and buckle up."
